         "comprehends": [
          "copies/ys250pr2232.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "stamped in a lighter, unevenly inked face, upright in the upper panel. The first and fifth figures are the same character, a closed curl with a tail running down to the left and no base stroke, which taken alone would read as a 9; read as 2, since 911195 gives neither a day nor a year while 211125 gives 21.11.25. The three 1s and the closing 5 are plain. Crop 2 carries a pencilled 5436, crop 3 only a crease."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
